<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12676" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποίητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not done, undone,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεπραγμένων ἀποίητον θέμεν ἔργων
					τέλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					2.18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πάμπολλ᾽ ἐστίν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					113
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>not to be done, impossible,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cor.</u>
				38
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>not artificial, unpolished,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				8
			</span></i>; esp. <i>unpoetical,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. λόγος,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιητική,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἀποίητα,</span> opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ πεποημένα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Po.</u>
				1081
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ὑπόθεσις</span>
			<i>not used as material for poetry,</i> ibid.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ.</span>
			<i>simplicity,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναϊϝετἐ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aristid.
				<u>Or.</u>
				31(11).4
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Dem.</u>
					39
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> of land,
				<i>unsuitable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴς τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					10.75.12
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
